    "detailed_description": "<h1>Coming soon!</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>Game revolves around resource gathering by chopping or mining, while keeping enought stamina to do it. <br><br><br><strong>Upgrade your fireplace</strong> to increase <strong>maximum stamina</strong> and regenerate it neat the fireplace faster.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2776630/extras/b6e70dc2d1a0993b9fec950609521e72.poster.avif?t=1719607028\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2776630/extras/b6e70dc2d1a0993b9fec950609521e72.webm?t=1719607028\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2776630/extras/b6e70dc2d1a0993b9fec950609521e72.mp4?t=1719607028\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br>To get <strong>new resources</strong> for your structures you can explore different areas. It may require building bridges and ladders.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2776630/extras/07e026f6eb2b1e8eca5d4c8b26fae948.poster.avif?t=1719607028\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2776630/extras/07e026f6eb2b1e8eca5d4c8b26fae948.webm?t=1719607028\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2776630/extras/07e026f6eb2b1e8eca5d4c8b26fae948.mp4?t=1719607028\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>To get more trees and rocks upgrade unlocked areas, so more new trees and stones will spawn.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2776630/extras/bad72009949f8429ab6349b6a25b8d80.poster.avif?t=1719607028\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2776630/extras/bad72009949f8429ab6349b6a25b8d80.webm?t=1719607028\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2776630/extras/bad72009949f8429ab6349b6a25b8d80.mp4?t=1719607028\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br>Using skills will upgrade them and increase efficency of hits, however when you reach the tier limit you have to upgrade corrseponding workbench. It will increase efficency hugely but also increase stamina spent.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2776630/extras/64cbcb80d24bca6ab3387d0ee14abbf0.poster.avif?t=1719607028\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2776630/extras/64cbcb80d24bca6ab3387d0ee14abbf0.webm?t=1719607028\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2776630/extras/64cbcb80d24bca6ab3387d0ee14abbf0.mp4?t=1719607028\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br>There are also renewable food sources such as berry bushes that can provide some fast stamina.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2776630/extras/c5b7c2feb53681edf25876c3b79c28ea.poster.avif?t=1719607028\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2776630/extras/c5b7c2feb53681edf25876c3b79c28ea.webm?t=1719607028\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2776630/extras/c5b7c2feb53681edf25876c3b79c28ea.mp4?t=1719607028\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
    "about_the_game": "Game revolves around resource gathering by chopping or mining, while keeping enought stamina to do it. <br><br><br><strong>Upgrade your fireplace</strong> to increase <strong>maximum stamina</strong> and regenerate it neat the fireplace faster.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2776630/extras/b6e70dc2d1a0993b9fec950609521e72.poster.avif?t=1719607028\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2776630/extras/b6e70dc2d1a0993b9fec950609521e72.webm?t=1719607028\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2776630/extras/b6e70dc2d1a0993b9fec950609521e72.mp4?t=1719607028\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br>To get <strong>new resources</strong> for your structures you can explore different areas. It may require building bridges and ladders.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2776630/extras/07e026f6eb2b1e8eca5d4c8b26fae948.poster.avif?t=1719607028\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2776630/extras/07e026f6eb2b1e8eca5d4c8b26fae948.webm?t=1719607028\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2776630/extras/07e026f6eb2b1e8eca5d4c8b26fae948.mp4?t=1719607028\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>To get more trees and rocks upgrade unlocked areas, so more new trees and stones will spawn.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2776630/extras/bad72009949f8429ab6349b6a25b8d80.poster.avif?t=1719607028\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2776630/extras/bad72009949f8429ab6349b6a25b8d80.webm?t=1719607028\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2776630/extras/bad72009949f8429ab6349b6a25b8d80.mp4?t=1719607028\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br>Using skills will upgrade them and increase efficency of hits, however when you reach the tier limit you have to upgrade corrseponding workbench. It will increase efficency hugely but also increase stamina spent.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2776630/extras/64cbcb80d24bca6ab3387d0ee14abbf0.poster.avif?t=1719607028\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2776630/extras/64cbcb80d24bca6ab3387d0ee14abbf0.webm?t=1719607028\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2776630/extras/64cbcb80d24bca6ab3387d0ee14abbf0.mp4?t=1719607028\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br>There are also renewable food sources such as berry bushes that can provide some fast stamina.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2776630/extras/c5b7c2feb53681edf25876c3b79c28ea.poster.avif?t=1719607028\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2776630/extras/c5b7c2feb53681edf25876c3b79c28ea.webm?t=1719607028\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2776630/extras/c5b7c2feb53681edf25876c3b79c28ea.mp4?t=1719607028\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
